> Documentation for self-managed 3.4. The current version is 3.5: <https://docs.quill.dev/keys/>.

# API keys

## Create a key

Sign in to Quill Cloud and open **Settings → Keys**.

## Rotate keys

Generate a new key, put it in `quill.yaml`, and restart the agent. To install the agent first, see [Install the agent](https://docs.quill.dev/3.4/install-agent/#install-agent).
